span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/35f50329389bfd50b413cdf7cbc2a564.avif?t=1753352115\" data-has-big width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a050+ unique ships drawn by Delu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some of these ships have walkable interiors that you can seamlessly enter and exit on foot or in a vehicle that fits through the doors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ origins, most of them unlockable after achieving certain feats in the campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a large amount and variety of quests:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dogfighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >securing locations through a shootout outside of your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving friendly ships in emergencies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some special quests that won't fit these categories\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mining</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ different solar systems with various orgs, locations and events in them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more cute anime girls</p></li></ul>",
